WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.701
-Guys, today is Friday,
and that's usually

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.934
when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:05.167
I check my in-box,
return some e-mails,

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.534
and, of course,
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:08.734
And I was running a bit behind.
Is that okay?

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:10.467
Can I write out
some thank-you notes now?

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:12.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
I appreciate that.

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:13.701
James, can I get some
thank-you-note-writing music,

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:14.767
please?

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:16.767
[ Soft music playing ]

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:27.801
Thank you, Ohio, for legalizing
recreational weed.

00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:30.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.534
Wait. You're telling me
a state known for eating chili

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:35.734
on top of spaghetti just now
legalized weed?

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.634
Come on.
-Ohio!

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:42.868
[ Soft music playing ]

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.634
-Thank you,
"The Golden Bachelor's"

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:48.033
"Women Tell All" episode,
for starting with a warning

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.634
that the show may be disturbing
to viewers under 65.

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:53.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.167
[ Soft music playing ]

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.167
Thank you, Election Day,
for forcing all of us

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:04.100
to make exceptionally
important decisions

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.534
in our old high-school
gymnasium.

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:09.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:13.067
[ Soft music playing ]

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:15.501
Thank you,
apartment smoke detector,

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:17.400
for alerting me
there's a fire by doing

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.234
a Mariah Carey impression.

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:21.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:27.367
[ Soft music playing ]

00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:29.601
Thank you, autocorrect,
for waiting

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:32.868
until the exact second I hit
"send" to ruin a message.

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:34.767
I mean, come on. What?

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.567
[ Soft music playing ]

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:46.100
Thank you, Pizza Hut
Hong Kong's new Snake Pizza,

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.200
for being the first time
a delivery guy says,

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.434
"Who ordered the snake pizza?",

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:51.200
and it's not the start
of a porno.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.667
You guys, we --
There you have it.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:53.901
Those are our thank-you notes.

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:56.634
We'll be right back with
Tom Hiddleston, everybody.

